  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 202.02 Hearings: Timing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 202.02 Hearings: Timing.\n\n(a) The department shall issue a hearing notice and hold a public hearing under Env-Wt 202.01(a) within the time established in RSA 482‑A:3, XIV(a)(3)(C) or RSA 482-A:3, XIV(a)(4)(C), as applicable.\n\n(b) The department shall issue a hearing notice and hold a public hearing under Env-Wt 202.01(b) in accordance with RSA 482-A:17, RSA 482-A:22, and RSA 482-A:22-a, as applicable.\n\nSource. #12802, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 200); ss by #13948, eff 4-30-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt200.html"
